XeFlash
Copyright 2026 the XeFlash authors

XeFlash is a reconstruction of YASAKANI for the Intel Xe architecture. It takes
the YASAKANI inference engine for Qwen3.8-27B as its starting point and
rebuilds it around the Xe2 GPU (Intel Arc Pro B60): a Rust host, SYCL/ESIMD
kernels and a weight format that feeds the XMX systolic array directly.

This product is based on software developed by the YASAKANI authors
(https://github.com/yasakani-dev/yasakani).
